♪ A beautiful day ♪

692
00:32:01,461 --> 00:32:03,046
♪ Waiting for you ♪

693
00:32:03,129 --> 00:32:05,381
♪ Just open your eyes ♪

694
00:32:05,465 --> 00:32:06,591
♪ You'll see it's true ♪

695
